    "extraction_notes": [
      "SI2310A is a 60V N-channel power MOSFET in SOT-23 package (page 1).",
      "RDS(ON) specifications: 67m\u03a9 typical at VGS=10V/ID=3A (80m\u03a9 max), 77m\u03a9 typical at VGS=4.5V/ID=2A (95m\u03a9 max).",
      "Input capacitance Ciss 490pF typical (780pF max), output capacitance Coss 55pF typical, reverse transfer capacitance Crss 40pF typical.",
      "Gate threshold voltage 1-3V (VDS=VGS, ID=250\u03bcA).",
      "Body diode forward voltage 1.2V typical at IS=1.2A.",
      "Breakdown voltage 60V minimum (VGS=0V, ID=250\u03bcA).",
      "Continuous drain current 3A at TA=25\u00b0C, 2.3A at TA=70\u00b0C (page 1).",
      "Power dissipation 1.38W at TA=25\u00b0C with 10\u00b0C/W derating factor and 90\u00b0C/W junction-to-ambient thermal resistance.",
      "Digitized curves: Fig 3 (RDS(ON) vs VGS, ID=2A) and Fig 5 (body diode forward characteristic, TJ=25\u00b0C) from pages 3-4.",
      "All numeric resistances in SI ohms (m\u03a9 converted to \u03a9), capacitances in SI farads (pF converted to F)."
